User: I'm preparing my 2024 taxes and could use your help. Situation: married filing jointly, Seattle WA. W-2 from Acme Corp: $82,350. Side income: $11,200 from web design (3 clients). Interest $2,340 (Chase savings), dividends $550 (Interactive Brokers). Home office: 155 sq ft, rent $1,820/month, apartment 680 sq ft. Deductions: student loan interest $4,400 (Sallie Mae, 2019–2020); charity $2,000 to...
